      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "check two ticket with best seat that has promo code first show happening in Hamilton New York on April.",
        "memory_description": "This is a ticket search task on SeatGeek where the agent failed to correctly identify and click on the right UI elements to apply a promo code and select the best seats for a show in Hamilton, NY on April.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Ticket Search with Promo Code Application\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the SeatGeek homepage.\n2. Use the search bar to input 'Hamilton New York April' to find the correct show.\n3. Click on the first show result that matches the event and date.\n4. Select the 'Best Seats' option from the seating chart or filter options.\n5. Click on the 'Add to Cart' button for two tickets.\n6. Proceed to checkout and apply the promo code in the designated promo code field.\n7. Confirm the promo code is applied and review the order summary.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the event name, location, and date are correctly matched in the search results.\n- Use explicit labels like 'Best Seats' or 'Select Seats' to identify the correct UI elements.\n- Apply the promo code only after selecting the tickets to ensure it is valid for the selected seats.\n- Always verify that the promo code field is present and correctly targeted before inputting the code."
      }
