        "scenario_description": "Find the cheapest women's plus size brown color loungewear in 3xl size.",
        "memory_description": "Product search task failed due to incorrect navigation steps and missing filters for size, color, and price; correct workflow requires applying filters sequentially before selecting items.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search on E-commerce Site (Kohls)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Women' category.\n2. Click on 'Plus Size' to filter by size.\n3. Select 'Loungewear' from the subcategory.\n4. Apply the 'Brown' color filter.\n5. Set the size filter to '3XL'.\n6. Sort results by 'Price: Low to High'.\n7. Click on the first item in the sorted list to view the cheapest option.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise filter selectors (e.g., 'Plus Size', 'Color', 'Size', 'Sort By').\n- Ensure filters are applied before proceeding to product listings.\n- Use exact match for filter values (e.g., '3XL', 'Brown', 'Loungewear').\n- Confirm that the 'Sort By' action is applied to the price attribute.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence (Syntax):\nCLICK [Women Category Element]\nCLICK [Plus Size Filter]\nCLICK [Loungewear Subcategory]\nCLICK [Color Filter: Brown]\nCLICK [Size Filter: 3XL]\nCLICK [Sort By: Price Low to High]\nCLICK [First Product in List]"
