        "scenario_description": "Rent a truck with the lowest rent with two dozen furniture pads for 100 miles at zip 08817 on April 12 at 2:30 pm rented truck is to be returned to the exact location and date, and the pickup and drop off will be at the nearest location.",
        "memory_description": "This is a rental booking task where the agent failed to correctly interact with UI elements, leading to incorrect selections and missing steps in the workflow.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Rental Booking\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the truck rental section of the website.\n2. Enter the zip code [08817] in the designated zip code field.\n3. Click on the 'Search' or 'Find Locations' button to retrieve available locations.\n4. Select the nearest location for both pickup and drop-off (same location, same date).\n5. Choose the rental date: April 12, 2023.\n6. Set the pickup time to 2:30 PM using the correct time format (e.g., 02:30 PM).\n7. Set the drop-off time to 2:30 PM on the same date.\n8. Select the rental duration as 'Same Day' or manually input 100 miles for the trip.\n9. Add 24 furniture pads to the rental cart.\n10. Proceed to checkout and confirm the rental with the lowest available rate.\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use `CLICK [element_id]` for buttons and `TYPE [element_id] [value]` for text fields.\n- Ensure time format matches the UI's expected format (e.g., 02:30 PM instead of 2:30 pm).\n- Confirm that the pickup and drop-off location and date are identical as per the task requirement."
      }
