      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Buy a diamond pass in New York's, Great escape park, add one meal dining plan to it, and select the flexible payment plan for Jame Jones. The email address is jame_jones@hotmail.com, zip code 10005 and age is 35.",
        "memory_description": "This is a multi-step e-commerce task where the agent failed due to incorrect element selection during form input and missed steps in selecting the meal plan and payment plan.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Multi-step e-commerce purchase with form input and selection.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Six Flags website and locate the 'Great Escape Park' section.\n2. Click on the 'Diamond Pass' option for New York's Great Escape Park.\n3. Add the 'One Meal Dining Plan' to the cart by clicking the appropriate add-on button.\n4. Proceed to checkout and enter the customer's name: 'Jame Jones' by typing into the first name field [TYPE [104848] [Jame]] and last name field [TYPE [130032] [Jones]].\n5. Enter the email address: 'jame_jones@hotmail.com' into the email field [TYPE [155234] [jame_jones@hotmail.com]].\n6. Input the zip code '10005' into the zip code field [TYPE [180904] [10005]].\n7. Enter the age '35' into the age field [TYPE [205548] [35]].\n8. Select the 'Flexible Payment Plan' option by clicking the corresponding radio button or selection box.\n9. Confirm the purchase by clicking the 'Complete Purchase' or 'Checkout' button.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the correct form fields are selected for each input (e.g., first name, last name, email, zip code, age).\n- Verify that the meal plan and payment plan are explicitly selected before proceeding to checkout.\n- Use exact element IDs and action syntax as provided in the HTML for accurate interaction."
      }
