        "scenario_description": "Browse the list of top 250 movies and add the first one to my watchlist.",
        "memory_description": "Navigation task failed due to incorrect element selection in step 1; correct workflow requires selecting the top movie title and then adding it to the watchlist.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation (IMDb Top 250 Movies)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the IMDb Top 250 Movies list by visiting the URL: https://www.imdb.com/chart/top/\n2. Locate the first movie title in the list (e.g., 'The Shawshank Redemption') by identifying the correct HTML element (e.g., <h3 class=\"lister-item-header\">).\n3. Click on the movie title to open its detail page.\n4. On the movie detail page, locate and click the 'Add to Watchlist' button (typically a button with class 'ipc-button' or similar).\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the correct element is selected by matching both class names and text content.\n- Use explicit selectors (e.g., CLICK [text='The Shawshank Redemption'] or CLICK [class='lister-item-header']).\n- Confirm the 'Add to Watchlist' button is clicked after navigating to the movie detail page."
      }
