      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Build an entry-level pc with an windows 11 64 bit intel i7 CPU with a256gb ssd drive +  4gb ram and adding cheapest component and accessories available.",
        "memory_description": "The task is a web-based PC component selection task on Newegg, where the agent failed due to incorrect element selection and missing steps in choosing the cheapest components, requiring a more precise action sequence.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web-based PC component selection on Newegg.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Newegg homepage and search for 'Intel i7 CPU' using the search bar.\n2. Select the first result that matches 'Intel i7' and is compatible with Windows 11 64-bit.\n3. Click on the 'Add to Cart' button for the selected CPU.\n4. Search for '256GB SSD' and select the cheapest option available, then click 'Add to Cart'.\n5. Search for '4GB RAM' and select the cheapest option, then click 'Add to Cart'.\n6. Search for 'PC Case' and select the cheapest compatible case, then click 'Add to Cart'.\n7. Search for 'Power Supply' and select the cheapest compatible unit, then click 'Add to Cart'.\n8. Search for 'Motherboard' compatible with the selected CPU and RAM, then click 'Add to Cart'.\n9. Search for 'Cooling System' and select the cheapest option, then click 'Add to Cart'.\n10. Review the cart to ensure all components are included and click 'Proceed to Checkout'.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use 'SELECT [element_id] [Lowest Price]' when choosing the cheapest option from a list.\n- Use 'CLICK [element_id]' when interacting with buttons like 'Add to Cart' or 'Proceed to Checkout'.\n- Ensure all components are compatible with the selected CPU and OS (Windows 11 64-bit)."
      }
