        "scenario_description": "Find 32\" Curved monitor and add the third one to the wish list.",
        "memory_description": "Product search and wishlist task failed due to incorrect filtering and missing selection of the third item; fix by refining search, filtering by size, and explicitly selecting the third item before adding to wishlist.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search and Wishlist Addition\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the search bar and TYPE [129] [32\" curved monitor] to ensure exact match for product name.\n2. Wait for search results to load, then SCROLL to locate the list of monitors.\n3. FILTER results by size (32\") and ensure 'curved' is included in the search or filter criteria.\n4. Once the list is refined, SELECT the third item in the list using CLICK [index=3] (or the correct element ID if available).\n5. After confirming the third item is selected, CLICK [98087] to add it to the wish list.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use exact product name and size in search input.\n- Use filters to narrow results before selecting items.\n- Ensure the third item is explicitly selected before adding to wishlist.\n- Use CLICK with correct element ID or index for precise interaction."
      }
