        "scenario_description": "Search the cheapest Curry brand unisex athletic shoes with the number 5.5, add to cart and checkout.",
        "memory_description": "Product search and purchase task failed due to incorrect element selection during filtering; fix by explicitly verifying filter options before proceeding.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search and Purchase\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Under Armour website.\n2. Use the search bar and type: `Curry unisex athletic shoes`.\n3. Filter results by brand: `Curry`.\n4. Filter by size: `5.5`.\n5. Sort results by price (ascending) to find the cheapest option.\n6. Click on the first item in the sorted list to view product details.\n7. Click `Add to Cart`.\n8. Navigate to the cart and click `Checkout`.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always confirm that the correct filter (e.g., size, brand, price) is applied before proceeding.\n- Use explicit selectors like `//button[contains(text(), 'Add to Cart')]` for actionable elements.\n- Ensure the selected product has the correct size and brand before adding to cart.\n- Use `//a[contains(text(), 'Checkout')]` to locate the checkout button."
      }
