        "scenario_description": "Browse spider-man toys for kids and sort by lowest price.",
        "memory_description": "Search and sort task failed due to incorrect initial search input and misselected UI elements; correct by typing search term first, then selecting sort option.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Search and Sort on E-commerce Site (Kohls)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Locate the search bar (typically a text input field with a magnifying glass icon) and type `spider-man toy` into it.\n2. Press the 'Enter' key or click the search button to execute the search.\n3. Once the results page loads, locate the 'Sort By' dropdown menu (usually near the top of the product listings).\n4. Click the dropdown and select 'Price: Low to High' to sort by lowest price.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use `TYPE [element_id] [search_term]` to input text into the search bar.\n- Use `CLICK [element_id]` to submit the search or select the sort option.\n- Ensure the correct element IDs are used for search and sort actions based on the current page's HTML structure."
