        "scenario_description": "Get the report from the final environmental impact statement for the Jamaica Bus Depot expansion.",
        "memory_description": "Search task failed due to incorrect element selection and case sensitivity in text input; correct by ensuring exact element IDs and case-matched search terms.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Search and Document Retrieval\n\nWebsite: new.mta.info\nGoal: Retrieve the report from the final environmental impact statement for the Jamaica Bus Depot expansion.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Click on the search box element [5984].\n2. Type 'jamaica bus depot expansion' (exact case-matched phrase) into the search box [8927].\n3. Click on the search results link element [12757].\n4. Click on the environmental impact statement link element [16587].\n5. Click on the 'Download Report' or equivalent button element [19133].\n6. Click on the final report link element [21625].\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure element IDs match exactly as specified in the target.\n- Use exact case-matched text for search inputs.\n- Confirm each step's element ID before performing an action."
