        "content_body": "Task Type: On-demand movie rental\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the movie search or browse section.\n2. Search for 'The Whale' and select the movie title from the results.\n3. Click the 'Rent' or 'Add to Cart' button to proceed.\n4. In the rental options or format selection screen, explicitly choose the 'high definition' format.\n5. Confirm the rental by clicking 'Continue' or 'Rent Now'.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the movie title 'The Whale' is selected correctly.\n- After adding the movie, look for a format selection dropdown or radio buttons and select 'high definition'.\n- Use exact action syntax: `CLICK [element_id]` with the correct element ID for each step."
      }
