        "scenario_description": "Browse the page with event planning tips.",
        "memory_description": "The task was a web navigation task to browse a page with event planning tips, but the agent failed due to incorrect element selection and missing steps in the interaction workflow.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation (Event Planning Tips Page)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Open the Eventbrite website.\n2. Use the search bar (typically located at the top of the page) to type 'event planning tips' and press Enter.\n3. From the search results, locate and click on a relevant article or resource page that contains event planning tips.\n4. Once on the target page, verify that the content includes event planning tips by scanning the page for relevant headings or sections.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use the search bar by clicking on it and entering the query.\n- Ensure the correct element is selected for interaction (e.g., the search input field, not a button or link).\n- Confirm the target page contains the desired content before proceeding.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence (Syntax):\n[CLICK [search_input]]\n[TYPE 'event planning tips']\n[CLICK [search_submit]]\n[CLICK [relevant_article_link]]"
      }
