        "memory_description": "This is a route planning task on the MBTA website. The agent failed due to incorrect element selection and case sensitivity in input fields, leading to incomplete task execution.",
        "content_body": "To plan a bus trip from Boston Logan Airport to South Station on the MBTA website, follow this correct workflow:\n\n1. Click on the 'Plan a Trip' or 'Find a Route' button (ensure correct element is selected).\n2. In the origin field, type 'Boston Logan Airport' (exact match, case-insensitive but ensure correct input field is used).\n3. Click on the 'Continue' or 'Next' button to proceed to the destination input.\n4. In the destination field, type 'South Station' (exact match, case-insensitive but ensure correct input field is used).\n5. Click on the 'Find Routes' or 'Search' button to retrieve available bus trips.\n\nEnsure that each step uses the correct UI element and input value, and that the input values match the expected format (e.g., 'South Station' not 'south station')."
