        "content_body": "Task Type: Web-based job search with filtering and application.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the MBTA careers or job board page (e.g., 'https://www.mbta.com/careers').\n2. Locate and click the 'Search Jobs' or 'View Openings' button (ensure correct element is selected).\n3. Apply filters: select 'Safety' as the job category and set salary to 'Above 100k' using the filter dropdowns or search bar.\n4. Click 'Search' or 'Apply Filters' to view matching job listings.\n5. Browse the filtered results and click on a job title to view details.\n6. Review the job description, requirements, and application instructions.\n7. Click the 'Apply' button or link to submit your application.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise element selectors (e.g., `CLICK [element_id]`) based on cleaned HTML.\n- Ensure filter parameters are correctly applied before searching.\n- Confirm that the job details page is accessed before attempting to apply."
