        "scenario_description": "Add my birthday detail, January 5, 1980, and dairy and peanut allergy in my profile, also add love ramen noodles to my bio, and save.",
        "memory_description": "Profile update task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing steps for allergy input and bio edit; correct workflow requires navigating to profile settings, selecting date fields, entering allergies, editing bio, and saving.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Profile Update\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to your profile settings (typically via user avatar or 'Profile' link in the header).\n2. Locate the 'Birthday' section and click on the date input field.\n3. Select the month: CLICK [month_dropdown] [January]\n4. Select the day: CLICK [day_dropdown] [05]\n5. Select the year: CLICK [year_dropdown] [1980]\n6. Find the 'Allergies' field and type: TYPE [allergies_input] [dairy, peanut]\n7. Locate the 'Bio' or 'About Me' section and edit: TYPE [bio_input] [Love ramen noodles]\n8. Scroll to the bottom of the profile settings and click 'Save' or 'Update Profile': CLICK [save_button]\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use dropdowns for date selection (month, day, year).\n- Use text input fields for allergies and bio edits.\n- Ensure 'Save' button is clicked after all changes are made."
      }
