      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Get the cheapest hotel room for 1 adult with a free wifi in Seoul from 10th to 12th April for work purposes with no prepayment and a review score of 7+.",
        "memory_description": "Hotel booking task failed due to incorrect element selection during filtering; correct workflow requires precise selection of filters for price, wifi, no prepayment, and review score.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Hotel Booking with Specific Filters\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the hotel booking page for Seoul.\n2. Set check-in date to 10th April and check-out date to 12th April.\n3. Select 1 adult.\n4. Click on the 'Filters' or 'Advanced Search' option.\n5. Apply the following filters:\n   - Price: Set to 'Cheapest' or sort by price ascending.\n   - Amenities: Ensure 'Free WiFi' is selected.\n   - Payment: Choose 'No Prepayment' or 'Pay at Hotel'.\n   - Review Score: Set to 7+.\n6. Click 'Apply' or 'Search' to filter results.\n7. Review the list of hotels that meet the criteria and select the cheapest option.\n8. Confirm the booking details and proceed with the reservation.\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use exact filter names as displayed on the website (e.g., 'Free WiFi', 'No Prepayment', 'Review Score 7+').\n- Ensure all filters are applied before proceeding to the results.\n- Click on the correct 'Apply' or 'Search' button after setting filters.\n- Verify that the final selection matches all specified criteria."
      }
