        "memory_description": "This was a web navigation task where the agent failed due to incorrect element selection in step 2; the correct workflow requires navigating to the used inventory filter for Model Y with performance all-wheel drive.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation (Filter-Based Inventory Search)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Tesla website and click on the 'Used' tab in the inventory section.\n2. Locate and click on the 'Model Y' filter option.\n3. Within the Model Y filters, select the 'Performance All-Wheel Drive' option.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise element identifiers (e.g., XPath or CSS selectors) for each step.\n- Ensure that each action matches the exact element and value as specified in the target.\n- Validate that the selected element is visible and interactive before performing a click.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence (Syntax):\nStep 1: CLICK [89]\nStep 2: CLICK [4621]\nStep 3: CLICK [12038]"
