        "content_body": "Task Type: Accommodation Booking\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Great Escape New Park' page on sixflags.com.\n2. Click on the 'Nearby Hotels' or 'Accommodations' section (element ID: 1043).\n3. Click on the 'Search Hotels' or 'Find a Place to Stay' button (element ID: 11811).\n4. Select the 'Check-in' date field (element ID: 21362) and click it.\n5. Click on the calendar icon or date picker (element ID: 29226) to select April 21, 2023.\n6. Select the 'Check-out' date field (element ID: 42547) and click it.\n7. Click on the calendar icon or date picker (element ID: 46822) to select April 24, 2023.\n8. Click on the 'Guests' or 'Number of Guests' field (element ID: 50596).\n9. Select '2 Adults' and '1 Child' from the dropdown options.\n10. Click on the 'Search' or 'Find Hotels' button (element ID: 58554).\n11. Filter results by 'Themed Rooms' or 'Themes' (element ID: 62496).\n12. Sort results by 'Price' or 'Cheapest First' (element ID: 68198).\n13. Click on the cheapest themed room option (element ID: 71885).\n14. Confirm the booking details and complete the reservation (element ID: 76419)."
      }
