      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Show me reviews for Elden Ring, best to worst.",
        "memory_description": "Product review sorting task failed due to incorrect initial search input and missing navigation to review sorting options; fix by first searching for the product, then locating and clicking the review sorting control.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Review Sorting\nWebsite: GameStop\nGoal: Show me reviews for Elden Ring, best to worst.\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the search bar (typically identified by an input element with placeholder text like 'Search for games, consoles, accessories...')\n2. TYPE [search_input_element] [Elden Ring]\n3. CLICK [search_submit_button_element] (usually a button with text 'Search' or an icon)\n4. Wait for search results to load\n5. Locate the product listing for 'Elden Ring' and CLICK [product_title_element] to view its page\n6. Scroll down to the 'Customer Reviews' section\n7. Locate the review sorting dropdown (often labeled 'Sort by' or 'Filter by')\n8. CLICK [sort_dropdown_element]\n9. SELECT [sort_option_element] [Best to Worst] or [Top Reviews] (depending on available options)\n10. CLICK [apply_sort_button_element] if needed\n11. Verify that the reviews are now displayed from best to worst."
      }
