        "content_body": "Task Type: Filtering and Selection on a Movie Rental Website (Redbox)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'New Releases' section by clicking the appropriate navigation link or menu item (e.g., CLICK [new_releases_link]).\n2. Locate and click the 'Filter by Genre' option (e.g., CLICK [filter_by_genre_button]).\n3. Select the 'Comedy' genre from the available options (e.g., CLICK [comedy_genre_option]).\n4. From the filtered list, click on a comedy movie to rent (e.g., CLICK [movie_title_element]).\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the 'New Releases' section is loaded before applying filters.\n- Confirm that the genre filter is applied before selecting a movie.\n- Use explicit element identifiers (e.g., text labels or unique IDs) for accurate interaction."
