        "memory_description": "The task was a search-based web navigation task where the agent failed to correctly select elements and input values to find an editor's choice review with a score of 10 in the boardgame category. The agent incorrectly selected elements and failed to input the exact value '10' in the correct field.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Search-based Web Navigation\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'boardgame' category section on the IGN website.\n2. Locate and click on the 'Editor's Choice' filter or section to view relevant reviews.\n3. Find the review score field (typically labeled 'Score' or 'Rating') and select it.\n4. Input the exact value '10' into the score field to filter reviews with a perfect score.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use `CLICK [element_id]` to interact with clickable elements like filters or sections.\n- Use `SELECT [element_id] [value]` to input exact values into form fields or filters.\n- Ensure the value matches the expected format (e.g., '10' not 'board' or 'Board').\n\nCorrect Action Sequence:\n1. `CLICK [606]` (to access the boardgame category)\n2. `CLICK [7762]` (to open the Editor's Choice section)\n3. `SELECT [13608] [10]` (to filter by a score of 10)\n4. `SELECT [18713] [Board]` (to confirm or refine the category if needed)"
      }
