        "scenario_description": "Find the most wanted contemporary Jazz album in the US from the last decade.",
        "memory_description": "Information retrieval task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing filtering steps; correct workflow requires navigating to the 'Most Wanted' section, applying genre and region filters, and sorting by release date.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Information Retrieval\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Most Wanted' section on Discogs.\n2. Use the filter options to select 'Jazz' as the genre and 'US' as the region.\n3. Apply a date filter to include only albums released in the last decade (2013–2023).\n4. Sort the results by 'Wanted' count or popularity to identify the most wanted album.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use `CLICK [element_id]` to select filters and sections.\n- Use `SELECT [element_id] [value]` to apply specific filter values (e.g., genre, region, date range).\n- Ensure all filters are applied before sorting results.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence:\n- `CLICK [288]` (Most Wanted section)\n- `SELECT [filter_genre] [Jazz]`\n- `SELECT [filter_region] [US]`\n- `SELECT [filter_date] [2013–2023]`\n- `CLICK [sort_by_wanted]`"
      }
