        "memory_description": "Search and interaction task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing navigation steps; correct workflow requires searching for the artist, navigating to their latest release, and adding it to the wantlist via proper UI interactions.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Search and Interaction Task\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. SEARCH [artist='Depeche Mode']\n2. CLICK [artist_result='Depeche Mode']\n3. CLICK [latest_release='Latest Release']\n4. CLICK [album_title='Album Title']\n5. CLICK [add_to_wantlist='Add to Wantlist']\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use SEARCH to find the artist on the homepage.\n- Click on the correct artist result to navigate to their profile.\n- Locate and click the 'Latest Release' section to view the most recent album.\n- Click the album title to open its page.\n- Find and click the 'Add to Wantlist' button to complete the task.\n\nSyntax:\n- Use exact match for element names (e.g., 'Add to Wantlist')\n- Ensure each action corresponds to a visible and clickable UI element."
