        "scenario_description": "Open the page with a overview about the submission of releases.",
        "memory_description": "Navigation task failed due to incorrect initial element selection; correct workflow requires selecting the proper menu item for submission overview.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Locate and click on the 'Submit' or 'Submit Releases' menu item in the main navigation bar (typically found in the top or sidebar menu). This will direct you to the submission overview page.\n2. If the 'Submit' option is not immediately visible, look for a 'Community' or 'Contribute' section and select 'Submit Releases' from there.\n3. Once on the submission overview page, verify that the URL contains '/submit' or '/submit-releases' to confirm the correct destination.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise element identifiers (e.g., text content or unique class names) to ensure correct selection.\n- Confirm each step by checking the URL and page content to ensure the correct navigation path is followed.\n- Avoid clicking on unrelated elements such as advertisements or unrelated links."
