        "memory_description": "Navigation task failed due to incorrect initial element selection; correct workflow requires clicking the 'Most Popular TV' link in the main navigation menu.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Locate the main navigation menu on the Rotten Tomatoes homepage.\n2. Identify the 'Most Popular TV' link (typically found under a 'TV' or 'Popular' section).\n3. Perform the action: CLICK [element_id], where [element_id] corresponds to the 'Most Popular TV' link in the navigation menu.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the element selected is a clickable link with visible text 'Most Popular TV'.\n- Avoid selecting elements with similar text but different context (e.g., movie sections or unrelated links).\n- Confirm the action syntax is: CLICK [element_id], with exact matching of the target element."
      }
