      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find the latest Game of Thrones toys  for English speakers and add the top two  result to the cart and checkout.",
        "memory_description": "E-commerce search task failed due to incorrect initial search action and missing language filter; correct workflow requires typing search term first, then applying language and category filters before selecting items.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: E-commerce search and purchase task.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. TYPE [search_box] [game of thrones] - Enter the search term in the search box.\n2. SELECT [language_filter] [English (1,161)] - Filter results to English language.\n3. SELECT [category_filter] [Toys (165)] - Narrow results to the 'Toys' category.\n4. CLICK [first_result] - Add the top result to the cart.\n5. CLICK [second_result] - Add the second result to the cart.\n6. CLICK [cart_icon] - Navigate to the cart.\n7. CLICK [checkout_button] - Proceed to checkout.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Identify the search box by its input type (e.g., 'text' or 'search') and label (e.g., 'Search' or 'Find').\n- Locate filters by their labels (e.g., 'Language', 'Category') and select the appropriate option (e.g., 'English', 'Toys').\n- Use 'CLICK' on product cards to add them to the cart.\n- Use 'CLICK' on the cart icon and checkout button to complete the purchase."
      }
    },
