      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Check travel requirements for trips between Tokyo and Guangzhou.",
        "memory_description": "Travel requirement check task failed due to incorrect final click selection; ensure the correct element is chosen for submitting or viewing the requirements.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Travel requirement check between two cities.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Qatar Airways website.\n2. Locate and click on the 'Travel Requirements' or 'Visa Information' section (element ID: 25161).\n3. Enter the origin city 'Tokyo' in the appropriate input field (element ID: 37913).\n4. Click on the 'Destination' or 'To' field (element ID: 64001).\n5. Enter the destination city 'Guangzhou' in the input field (element ID: 75898).\n6. Click on the 'Check Requirements' or 'Submit' button (element ID: 102055).\n7. Ensure the correct final button is clicked (element ID: 113921), not 118883, to view the travel requirements.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always verify the element ID matches the target action.\n- Confirm the input fields are correctly populated with the city names.\n- Double-check the final action element before clicking to avoid mismatches."
      }
