        "scenario_description": "Find a store in Tempe, Arizona,  make it my store, and then visit the store page and see whats happening in store.",
        "memory_description": "Location-based store search task failed due to incorrect selection of store location and missing steps to set the store and view in-store events.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Location-based Store Search and Interaction\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Stores' section of the IKEA website.\n2. Use the search bar to input 'Tempe, Arizona' and select the correct location from the dropdown (e.g., SELECT [4382] [Tempe, AZ]).\n3. Click on the 'Make this my store' button (e.g., CLICK [10802]).\n4. Visit the store page by clicking on the store name or 'Store page' link (e.g., CLICK [15833]).\n5. Look for the 'What’s happening in store' section and click on it (e.g., CLICK [20396]).\nUI Interaction Rules: Always confirm location selection from dropdowns, ensure 'Make this my store' is clicked before proceeding, and explicitly navigate to the 'What’s happening in store' section."
      }
