      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find a bedroom nightstand made from solid wood and compare the top three highest-rated products, and show only the differences.",
        "memory_description": "Product comparison task failed due to incorrect navigation and filtering steps; fix by explicitly filtering for solid wood nightstands and systematically comparing top-rated products.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Comparison\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the IKEA website and search for 'bedroom nightstand'.\n2. Use the filter options to select 'solid wood' as the material.\n3. Sort products by 'highest ratings' to identify the top three.\n4. Click on each of the top three products to view their details.\n5. Extract key attributes (e.g., dimensions, price, features) for each product.\n6. Compare the three products by highlighting differences in the extracted attributes.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use the search bar with `SEARCH [bedroom nightstand]`.\n- Click on the filter icon and select `FILTER [material: solid wood]`.\n- Click on the 'Sort by' dropdown and select `SORT [highest ratings]`.\n- Click on the first, second, and third product cards with `CLICK [product card 1]`, `CLICK [product card 2]`, `CLICK [product card 3]`.\n- Extract attributes using `EXTRACT [price, dimensions, features]` for each product.\n- Compare differences using `COMPARE [product 1 vs product 2 vs product 3]`."
      }
    },
