        "content_body": "Task Type: Filtering and Media Interaction on SoundCloud\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Trending' section on SoundCloud.\n2. Locate and click the 'Filter' option (usually a tag or filter button).\n3. Type `#Electronics` into the filter input field and apply the filter.\n4. Scroll through the filtered trending playlists and locate the track `Countdown by Adrien Brunelat`.\n5. Click the play button on the track to play it.\n6. Once the track is playing, click the 'Like' button (heart icon) to favorite it.\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise element identifiers (e.g., `CLICK [element_id]` where applicable).\n- Ensure filter input is correctly populated with `#Electronics` before proceeding.\n- Confirm track title matches exactly before interacting with play/like buttons."
