        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search and Comparison\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'External Hard Drives' category on GameStop.\n2. Use the search bar to type 'external hard drive' and press Enter.\n3. Filter results by 'Xbox One' compatibility using the 'Compatibility' filter dropdown.\n4. Sort results by 'Price: Low to High' using the sorting option.\n5. Click on the first item in the sorted list to view details.\n6. Confirm the price and compatibility details on the product page.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use the search bar for initial filtering.\n- Always apply platform-specific filters (e.g., 'Xbox One') before sorting.\n- Use the 'Sort by Price' option to find the cheapest item.\n- Ensure each click action targets the correct UI element (e.g., filter dropdown, sort button, product link)."
