      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Check my AMC gift card balance with gift card number 87654321 and pin number 9753.",
        "memory_description": "For tasks requiring checking a gift card balance, the workflow involves navigating to the correct page and entering the gift card and PIN sequentially.",
        "content_body": "1. Navigate to the gift card balance check page, typically found under a 'Gift Cards' or 'Account' section of the website.\n2. Locate and click the 'Check Balance' or similar button to proceed.\n3. Identify the gift card number input field (usually labeled 'Gift Card Number' or 'Card Number') and type the provided gift card number (e.g., 87654321).\n4. Locate the PIN input field (often labeled 'PIN' or 'Security Code') and type the provided PIN (e.g., 9753).\n5. Click the 'Submit' or 'Check Balance' button to retrieve the balance.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the correct input fields are selected by verifying their labels before typing.\n- Avoid skipping steps or entering data into the wrong fields, as this may result in errors or failed submissions.\n- Wait for the input fields to be fully loaded and interactive before typing or clicking.\n\nPitfalls:\n- Entering the PIN in the gift card number field or vice versa will result in failure.\n- Some websites may require additional verification steps, such as entering an email or confirming terms and conditions, which should be checked before submission."
      }
