        "scenario_description": "Add two Maryla\nnd park all-season go-cart passes add-on in the cart, and choose the digital ticket option.",
        "memory_description": "Add-to-cart task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing steps; correct workflow requires precise navigation to the add-on product, selecting the correct quantity, and choosing the digital ticket option.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Add-to-cart with specific product selection and option choice.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Tickets' or 'Add-Ons' section of the Six Flags website.\n2. Locate and click on the 'Maryland Park All-Season Go-Cart Pass Add-On' product listing.\n3. Select the quantity '2' using the quantity selector (e.g., CLICK [quantity_selector] then TYPE [quantity_input] 2).\n4. Choose the 'Digital Ticket' option by clicking the corresponding radio button or selection field (e.g., CLICK [digital_ticket_option]).\n5. Add the item to the cart by clicking the 'Add to Cart' button (e.g., CLICK [add_to_cart_button]).\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the correct product name is selected (e.g., 'Maryland Park All-Season Go-Cart Pass Add-On').\n- Confirm the quantity input field is correctly targeted and updated.\n- Verify the 'Digital Ticket' option is explicitly selected before adding to cart.\n- Use exact element identifiers (e.g., CLICK [11779], TYPE [95827] 2) as determined by the website's DOM structure."
      }
