        "content_body": "Task Type: Rating Task\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Search for 'The Terminator II: Judgement Day' using the search bar (typically a text input with a 'Search' button).\n2. Navigate to the movie's detail page by clicking on the correct search result.\n3. Locate the rating section (usually a star rating system or a 'Rate' button).\n4. Click on the 'Rate' button or the appropriate star to select a 10 rating.\n5. Confirm the rating submission if required (e.g., by clicking a 'Submit' or 'Save' button).\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use `TYPE [movie_title]` to input the movie name into the search field.\n- Use `CLICK [search_button]` to submit the search.\n- Use `CLICK [movie_result]` to navigate to the movie page.\n- Use `CLICK [rating_element]` to select the desired rating (e.g., 10 stars).\n- Use `CLICK [submit_rating]` to confirm the rating if needed."
      }
