      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Book the cheapest economy flight between Miami and Nairobi for two adults on May 4 with a return option on May 8.",
        "memory_description": "This is a flight booking task where the agent failed to correctly select UI elements for specifying passenger details and return date, leading to incomplete form submission.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Flight Booking\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the JetBlue homepage and click on the 'Book a Flight' option.\n2. In the origin field, type 'Miami' and select the correct city from the dropdown.\n3. In the destination field, type 'Nairobi' and select the correct city from the dropdown.\n4. Select the departure date as May 4 using the date picker.\n5. Click on the 'Return' option and select May 8 as the return date.\n6. Click on the 'Passengers' section and select '2 adults' from the dropdown.\n7. Click on the 'Search Flights' button to view available options.\n8. From the results, select the cheapest economy flight option and proceed to checkout.\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the correct city is selected from the dropdown after typing in origin/destination fields.\n- Use the date picker to select exact dates, not just clicking on calendar elements.\n- Confirm passenger count is set to '2 adults' before proceeding.\n- Always verify that the 'return' date is selected after the departure date.\n- Use the 'Search Flights' button to finalize the search and view results."
      }
