        "scenario_description": "Add a front load washing machine under $800 to the cart.",
        "memory_description": "Product search task failed due to missing filtering step for price under $800; correct workflow includes filtering by price before adding to cart.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search and Add to Cart\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Washing Machines' category on Menards.\n2. Use the search/filter UI to select 'Front Load Washing Machine'.\n3. Apply a price filter to show items under $800.\n4. Click on a product that meets the criteria.\n5. Click the 'Add to Cart' button.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use the search bar or category filters to narrow results.\n- Apply price range filters before selecting items.\n- Ensure the product price is explicitly under $800 before adding to cart.\n- Use exact element IDs or labels for clicks (e.g., CLICK [add_to_cart_button])."
      }
