        "scenario_description": "Add the #1 and #2 ranked boardgame to a collection.",
        "memory_description": "Collection management task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing steps for locating and adding top-ranked boardgames; fix by explicitly navigating to rankings and using correct UI interactions.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Collection Management on BoardGameGeek\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Top Board Games' page (e.g., https://boardgamegeek.com/rankings/boardgame).\n2. Locate the #1 ranked boardgame by finding the first entry in the rankings table.\n3. Click the 'Add to Collection' button (typically a 'Add' or 'Add to Collection' link or button) associated with the #1 ranked game.\n4. Repeat step 2 and 3 for the #2 ranked boardgame.\n5. Confirm the addition by checking the collection page or receiving a success message.\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise selectors for ranking entries (e.g., `//div[@class='ranking-entry']` for each row).\n- Ensure the 'Add to Collection' action is performed on the correct game entry.\n- Use `CLICK [element_id]` syntax for interactions and `TYPE [element_id] [value]` for input fields if required."
      }
