      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Get the nearest attorney in West Hollywood, Florida, who can handle drug charges, accepts credit cards, and speaks Spanish.",
        "memory_description": "Location-based search task failed due to incorrect city input and misselected UI elements; fix by using exact location names and verifying element IDs before interaction.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Location-based professional search (attorney search with filters)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the search bar (element ID: 175) and click it.\n2. Type the exact location name 'West Hollywood, Florida' into the search field (element ID: 956) without abbreviation or extra text.\n3. Click the 'Search' button (element ID: 9957) to initiate the search.\n4. From the results, click the 'Attorney' category filter (element ID: 18682) to narrow down results.\n5. Apply the 'Drug Charges' filter by clicking the corresponding checkbox (element ID: 22851).\n6. Apply the 'Accepts Credit Cards' filter by clicking the corresponding checkbox (element ID: 32182).\n7. Apply the 'Speaks Spanish' filter by clicking the corresponding checkbox (element ID: 41842).\n8. Click the 'Sort by Distance' option (element ID: 51507) to get the nearest attorney.\n9. Click the first result in the sorted list (element ID: 70824) to view attorney details.\n10. Verify the attorney's profile by clicking the 'View Profile' button (element ID: 80465).\n11. Confirm the attorney's services by clicking the 'Services' tab (element ID: 90112).\n12. Finalize by clicking the 'Contact' button (element ID: 96095) to get contact information.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always use exact location names as displayed on the website.\n- Verify element IDs match the current page's HTML before clicking.\n- Apply filters sequentially and confirm each step before proceeding."
      }
    },
