      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find only SUVs & Wagons that can be picked up at SFO on April 20, 2023 and returned on April 27, 2023.",
        "memory_description": "Filter-based search task failed due to incorrect location input and misselected UI elements; correct by using airport code and following precise filter steps.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Filter-based search on a car rental website.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the car rental website (e.g., 'budget') and locate the 'Pickup Location' field.\n2. Click on the 'Pickup Location' field.\n3. Type 'SFO' into the input field to select San Francisco International Airport.\n4. Set the 'Pickup Date' to April 20, 2023, using the date picker.\n5. Set the 'Return Date' to April 27, 2023, using the date picker.\n6. Locate the 'Vehicle Type' filter (e.g., 'SUV' and 'Wagon') and click to select both options.\n7. Click the 'Search' or 'Find Cars' button to retrieve the filtered results.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use airport codes (e.g., 'SFO') for location input.\n- Ensure all filters (dates, vehicle types) are applied before searching.\n- Confirm that the correct elements are clicked based on their unique identifiers or labels in the HTML."
      }
