        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search and Add-to-Cart\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Shop' or 'All Products' section on the REI website.\n2. Use the search bar and type 'Yaktrax traction cleats' to locate the product.\n3. Filter the results by 'Size' and select 'Large' to narrow down the options.\n4. Click on the first relevant product to open its detail page.\n5. Click the 'Add to Cart' button located on the product detail page.\n6. Verify the item was added to the cart by checking the cart icon or navigating to the cart page.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise search terms to avoid irrelevant results.\n- Always filter by size before selecting a product.\n- Ensure the 'Add to Cart' button is clicked on the product detail page, not on a listing page.\n- Confirm the correct product is in the cart before proceeding."
