      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find the list of all neighborhood maps for Brooklyn",
        "memory_description": "For tasks requiring navigation to a specific list of neighborhood maps, a direct sequence of clicks on relevant menu items is effective.",
        "content_body": "1. Identify the main navigation menu or section that contains geographic or location-based options. 2. Click on the menu item corresponding to 'Brooklyn' or a similar regional category. 3. Look for a sub-menu or link labeled 'Neighborhood Maps' or a similar term, and click on it. Ensure that each click is on the correct element, and wait for the page to fully load between steps. A common pitfall is clicking on a general 'Maps' link without verifying that it leads to neighborhood-specific content. Always confirm the page title or content after each click to ensure it aligns with the task goal."
      }
