      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find the statistics of the player Cristiano Ronaldo for the national team of Portugal in all the world cups.",
        "memory_description": "This is a data retrieval task where the agent failed to correctly select the 'World Cup' filter due to a mismatch in the option label, requiring precise UI interaction with dropdowns.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Data Retrieval\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the ESPN website and search for 'Cristiano Ronaldo' using the search bar.\n2. Click on the player's profile or relevant article link.\n3. Locate and click on the 'National Team' or 'International Stats' section.\n4. Find the dropdown or filter menu that allows selecting tournaments (e.g., World Cup).\n5. Select the option labeled 'World Cup' from the dropdown menu.\n6. Retrieve and confirm the statistics displayed for Portugal's national team in World Cup matches.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the exact label 'World Cup' is selected from the dropdown, not similar options like 'fifa.world' or 'International Tournaments'.\n- Use the correct syntax: SELECT [element_id] [\"World Cup\"] to ensure accurate selection.\n- Verify that the selected filter applies to the national team of Portugal before retrieving data."
      }
