        "memory_description": "Navigation task failed due to missing steps in accessing the Italian Serie A schedule for April 8th, 2023; correct workflow requires explicitly selecting the correct date and league before retrieving fixtures.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation (Schedule Lookup)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the ESPN homepage.\n2. CLICK [10378] to access the 'Soccer' section.\n3. CLICK [58775] to open the 'Soccer Schedules' page.\n4. CLICK [74843] to select the 'Serie A' league.\n5. CLICK [90056] to open the schedule calendar.\n6. CLICK [103562] to select the date 'April 8th, 2023'.\n7. CLICK [132063] to view the fixtures for that date.\n8. CLICK [160814] to confirm and retrieve the schedule details.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure each step corresponds to the correct element ID as identified in the HTML.\n- If a date or league is not immediately visible, use the calendar or filter options to locate it.\n- Always verify that the selected date and league match the task goal before proceeding."
