        "scenario_description": "View top-rated new restaurants in Toronto and book a table for two for lunch on April 22, am in any Malaysian restaurant after 9 pm for dinner services.",
        "memory_description": "This is a restaurant booking task on Resy where the agent failed to correctly select UI elements for guest count and possibly missed navigation steps, requiring a precise action sequence for successful booking.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Restaurant Booking\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Toronto' location filter and ensure it is selected.\n2. Use the search or filter options to view 'top-rated new restaurants' in Toronto.\n3. Filter results to show only 'Malaysian' cuisine.\n4. Click on a restaurant that offers dinner service after 9 PM.\n5. Click the 'Reserve' or 'Book a Table' button.\n6. Select the date: April 22, and time: 'After 9 PM' for dinner.\n7. Select the number of guests: '2 Guests' (ensure the correct UI element is clicked, not just selected).\n8. Confirm the booking details and proceed to complete the reservation.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always click on the exact UI element (e.g., '2 Guests' button) rather than selecting from a dropdown or input field.\n- Ensure the date and time are explicitly set to match the task requirements.\n- Verify that the restaurant selected is open for dinner after 9 PM on the specified date."
      }
