        "scenario_description": "Add Pro Display XDR with nano texture to bag with all the accessories and check total.",
        "memory_description": "Product configuration task failed due to missing steps in selecting the nano texture option and adding accessories; correct workflow requires explicit selection of display variant and accessories before adding to cart.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Configuration & Purchase\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Pro Display XDR product page.\n2. Locate and click the 'Select Display' or 'Choose Variant' option.\n3. Select the 'Nano Texture' option from the available display finishes.\n4. Scroll down to the 'Accessories' section.\n5. Click 'Add to Bag' for each required accessory (e.g., stand, cables, etc.).\n6. Click 'Add to Bag' for the Pro Display XDR with nano texture.\n7. Navigate to the cart and verify that all items (display and accessories) are included.\n8. Check the total price at the bottom of the cart page.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always confirm variant selections (e.g., 'Nano Texture') before proceeding.\n- Use explicit 'Add to Bag' actions for each item, not just the main product.\n- Ensure all steps are completed before checking the total."
      }
