        "scenario_description": "Browse used Audi cars made before 2015 and sort by lowest price",
        "memory_description": "Filter and sort task failed due to incorrect selection of sort option and missing year filter; correct by first applying year filter then sorting by price.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Filter and Sort Web Task\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the used car listings section on the KBB website.\n2. Locate and click the 'Year' filter option to set the maximum year to 2014 (or select 'Before 2015').\n3. Apply the filter to narrow down the results to Audi cars made before 2015.\n4. Find the 'Sort By' option (typically a dropdown menu) and select 'Price: Low to High' from the available options.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use 'CLICK' to interact with filter and sort buttons.\n- Use 'SELECT' with the exact label (e.g., 'Price: Low to High') to ensure correct sorting.\n- Ensure all filters are applied before sorting to avoid incorrect results."
