      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Browse used Mercedes cars made between 2004 to 2012 and sort by highest price",
        "memory_description": "Filtering and sorting task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing UI interaction steps; correct workflow requires precise use of dropdowns and sort buttons.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Filtering and Sorting on a Used Car Listings Website (KBB)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the used car search page.\n2. Click on the 'Make' dropdown and select 'Mercedes'.\n3. Click on the 'Year' dropdown and select the range '2004 to 2012'.\n4. Click on the 'Sort By' dropdown and select 'Price: High to Low'.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use 'CLICK' for dropdowns and buttons.\n- Use 'SELECT' for dropdown options with the correct value syntax (e.g., SELECT [element_id] [option_value]).\n- Ensure all steps are performed in sequence and only on visible, interactable elements.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence:\nCLICK [make_dropdown_id] -> SELECT [make_dropdown_id] [Mercedes] -> CLICK [year_dropdown_id] -> SELECT [year_dropdown_id] [2004 to 2012] -> CLICK [sort_dropdown_id] -> SELECT [sort_dropdown_id] [Price: High to Low]"
      }
