        "content_body": "Task Type: Restaurant Reservation\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the restaurant search page on exploretock.\n2. Use the search bar to TYPE [location] [Buchanan, MI].\n3. CLICK [search button] to filter results.\n4. SELECT [cuisine type] [Spanish cuisine] from the cuisine filter.\n5. SELECT [dine in] from the reservation type dropdown.\n6. SELECT [date] [18th of March] from the date picker.\n7. SELECT [time] [8:00 PM] from the time dropdown (ensure correct format: 8:00 PM, not 20:00).\n8. SELECT [number of guests] [2 guests] from the guest count dropdown.\n9. CLICK [search or filter button] to view available restaurants.\n10. CLICK [book now] on a restaurant listing to proceed with reservation.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always use the exact format for time (e.g., 8:00 PM, not 20:00).\n- Ensure all filters (cuisine, reservation type, date, time, guests) are applied before searching.\n- Confirm each selection matches the target element and value exactly."
      }
