        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search and Cart Addition\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Menards website and go to the 'Vacuums' category.\n2. Use the search bar to type 'Swivel vacuum' to filter relevant products.\n3. Apply a price filter to ensure only items under $150 are shown (e.g., click on the price range filter and set max to 150).\n4. From the filtered results, locate a swivel vacuum and click on its 'Add to Cart' button.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise search terms ('Swivel vacuum') to narrow results.\n- Always apply price filters before selecting items.\n- Ensure the 'Add to Cart' button is clicked on the product detail page, not a search result listing.\n- Verify the product price is under $150 before proceeding."
