      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Select a E-Gift card with Congrats design and add to cart with Best Wishes as a message. Send it to James Smith with email abc@abc.com",
        "memory_description": "E-Gift card selection and personalization task failed due to incorrect message input and missing steps for email and design selection; fix by following correct UI interaction sequence.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: E-Gift card selection and personalization.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the E-Gift card section on rei.com.\n2. Select the 'Congrats' design by clicking the corresponding card element.\n3. Click on the 'Personalize' or 'Add Message' field (element ID: 63066) to input the message.\n4. Type 'Best Wishes' into the message field (element ID: 63066).\n5. Click on the 'Recipient Name' field (element ID: 86326) and type 'James Smith'.\n6. Click on the 'Email' field (element ID: 132865) and type 'abc@abc.com'.\n7. Confirm the gift card amount by typing '100' into the amount field (element ID: 156131).\n8. Review all details and click 'Add to Cart' (element ID: 225984) to complete the task.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always verify the correct element ID before performing an action.\n- Ensure message, name, and email fields are filled in the correct order.\n- Confirm the gift card design is selected before proceeding to personalization."
      }
