      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Download the e-receipt with the last name Smith and confirmation number X123456989.",
        "memory_description": "For tasks requiring downloading an e-receipt with specific filters, ensure accurate input of search criteria and precise interaction with form elements.",
        "content_body": "1. Navigate to the receipt or download section of the website, typically found in a 'My Account' or 'Transactions' area.\n2. Locate and click on a search or filter option to initiate the receipt lookup process.\n3. Enter the required last name (e.g., 'Smith') into the appropriate text field, ensuring the correct element is selected for input.\n4. Input the confirmation number (e.g., 'X123456989') into the designated confirmation number field, again verifying the correct element is targeted.\n5. After entering both search criteria, click the 'Search', 'Find', or 'Download' button to retrieve the e-receipt.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always confirm the correct input field is selected before typing to avoid data misplacement.\n- Ensure that all fields are fully populated with the exact required values (e.g., confirmation numbers are case-sensitive and must match exactly).\n- Wait for any dynamic elements (e.g., dropdowns, search results) to load fully before proceeding to the next step.\n\nCommon Pitfalls:\n- Typing in the wrong field (e.g., entering a confirmation number into a last name field).\n- Missing a required field, which may prevent the search from executing.\n- Clicking a button before all input fields are populated, which may result in an incomplete or incorrect search."
      }
