      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find and select the car with the most number of seats to pick up in a top airport location in alabama on april 10",
        "memory_description": "This is a car rental selection task where the agent incorrectly typed a location instead of clicking it, and failed to select the correct date and car with the most seats.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Car Rental Selection\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. CLICK [115] to open the car rental search.\n2. CLICK [9886] to select the pickup location.\n3. CLICK [14857] to search for 'Birmingham-Shuttlesworth Intl, Birmingham, AL, United States-(BHM)'.\n4. CLICK [31840] to select the date 'April 10'.\n5. CLICK [45913] to view available cars.\n6. CLICK [59961] to filter by the most number of seats.\n7. CLICK [79685] to select the car with the most seats.\n8. CLICK [99488] to confirm the selection.\n9. CLICK [119649] to complete the booking.\nUI Rules: Always click on location/date filters instead of typing, and ensure the car with the highest seat count is selected."
      }
