        "scenario_description": "search the cheapest small car rental deals from Little Ferry, New Jersey, United States on 23th March to same location dropoff on april 4th 2pm.",
        "memory_description": "This is a car rental search task on Kayak where the agent failed to input the pickup location correctly, leading to incomplete or incorrect search parameters. The fix involves ensuring the pickup location is properly typed before proceeding.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Car Rental Search\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Kayak car rental search page.\n2. Locate the 'Pickup Location' field (typically a text input box with an icon or label 'Pickup Location').\n3. Type the pickup location: `little ferry, new jersey, united states` into the input field.\n4. Confirm the location is selected or auto-filled correctly (if applicable).\n5. Click on the 'Pickup Date' field and select the date: `March 23`.\n6. Click on the 'Dropoff Date' field and select the date: `April 4`.\n7. Ensure the dropoff time is set to `2:00 PM` if available.\n8. Select the car type: `small car` from the appropriate dropdown or filter.\n9. Click the 'Search' button to retrieve the cheapest deals.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always verify that the location is fully typed and matches the expected value.\n- Ensure dates and times are selected in the correct format and order (pickup before dropoff).\n- Confirm car type filters are applied before initiating the search."
