      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find a resort near Patong beach in Phuket, Thailand nearest to the airport from May 9 to May 12 for two with a pay-later option.",
        "memory_description": "This is a hotel search task on Agoda where the agent failed to correctly navigate through the UI to select the required filters and options, specifically missing the pay-later option and location refinement steps.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Hotel Search with Filters\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to Agoda's homepage and click on 'Hotels' in the main navigation bar.\n2. In the search bar, type 'Patong Beach, Phuket, Thailand' and press Enter.\n3. On the search results page, click on the 'Filters' button (usually located on the left sidebar).\n4. Under the 'Location' section, select 'Near Patong Beach' and ensure 'Nearest to Airport' is checked.\n5. Set the check-in date to May 9 and check-out date to May 12.\n6. Set the number of guests to 2 (1 room, 2 adults).\n7. Scroll down to the 'Payment' section and select the 'Pay Later' option.\n8. Click 'Apply Filters' to refine the results.\n9. Browse the filtered results and select a suitable resort.\nUI Interaction Rules: Use precise click actions on visible elements, ensure all filters are applied before proceeding, and verify that the 'Pay Later' option is explicitly selected."
      }
