        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation with Filtering\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Kohls website.\n2. Locate and click on the 'Clearance' section (typically found in the main navigation menu or via a dedicated link).\n3. Once in the clearance section, locate the filter options (usually on the left-hand side or top of the page).\n4. Click on the 'Women's' category filter to narrow results to women's clothing.\n5. Within the size filter, select 'Small' to further narrow results.\n6. Ensure that the filters are applied correctly by verifying the displayed items match the criteria (women's dresses in size small).\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use explicit text-based selectors for filters (e.g., 'Women's', 'Dresses', 'Size: Small').\n- Confirm that the selected elements are visible and interactable in the DOM before clicking.\n- Avoid clicking on elements that are not part of the filter interface (e.g., product cards, banners, or unrelated links)."
      }
