      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Book a place on the next available mountain biking class running within 100 miles of New York City for Joe Bloggs. The email address is joe@joebloggs.com and the phone number is 1111111111. Emergency contact's name is June and phone number is 2222222222. The gear sizing is 6 ft height\n.",
        "memory_description": "Location-based booking task failed due to incorrect selection of filters and missing steps in the class search workflow; correct by explicitly selecting 'Mountain Biking' category, applying the 'Within 100 miles of New York City' filter, and completing all required form fields before finalizing the booking.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Location-based Class Booking\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Classes' or 'Cycling' section of the website.\n2. Select the 'Mountain Biking' category from the available filters.\n3. Use the 'Location' filter and type 'New York City' into the search field.\n4. Apply the 'Within 100 miles' radius filter to narrow results.\n5. Select the next available class from the results list.\n6. Click on the 'Book Now' or 'Reserve' button to proceed to the registration form.\n7. Fill in the following details:\n   - Full Name: Joe Bloggs\n   - Email: joe@joebloggs.com\n   - Phone Number: 1111111111\n   - Emergency Contact Name: June\n   - Emergency Contact Phone: 2222222222\n   - Gear Sizing: 6 ft height\n8. Review all information for accuracy.\n9. Click the 'Submit' or 'Confirm Booking' button to finalize the reservation.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use SELECT [element_id] [value] for dropdowns and filters.\n- Use TYPE [element_id] [text] for text input fields.\n- Use CLICK [element_id] for buttons and links.\n- Ensure all form fields are completed before proceeding to the final confirmation step."
      }
