      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find thrill rides in Six Flags Great America, Chicago, IL.",
        "memory_description": "This was a ride search task on a theme park website; the agent failed due to incorrect element selection and missing navigation steps; the correct workflow involves locating the ride category filter and applying it before selecting rides.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Ride Search on Theme Park Website\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the main rides or attractions page of Six Flags Great America.\n2. Locate the ride category filter (e.g., 'Thrill Rides') using a SELECT action on the appropriate dropdown or filter element.\n3. Click the 'Thrill Rides' option to apply the filter.\n4. Once filtered, scroll through or click on the ride list to view details.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use SELECT on dropdowns or filters to choose categories.\n- Use CLICK on ride names or thumbnails to view details.\n- Ensure each step matches the exact element ID and action type as specified in the target.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence (Syntax):\nSELECT [category_filter_element_id] -> CLICK [thrill_rides_option_id] -> CLICK [ride_thumbnail_or_name_id]"
      }
    },
