        "scenario_description": "Check in with confirmation number 10987654 for my flight with last name Lewis.",
        "memory_description": "For tasks requiring check-in with a confirmation number and last name, the workflow involves locating the check-in form, entering the confirmation number and last name, and submitting the form.",
