      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Show the highest-rated boxing gym with a personal training facility and Monthly membership options in Dallas, Texas",
        "memory_description": "Location-based search task failed due to incorrect navigation steps and missing input for 'Dallas' and membership filters; correct workflow requires explicit location input and filtering by facility type and membership options.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Location-based search with filters.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to Yelp's search bar and type 'boxing gym Dallas, Texas' to set location and search term.\n2. Click [Search] to load results.\n3. Use the 'Filters' option (typically found on the left sidebar or top navigation bar) to select 'Personal Training' under 'Facilities' and 'Monthly Membership' under 'Membership Options'.\n4. Sort results by 'Rating' (highest first) to find the top-rated gym.\n5. Click on the highest-rated gym to view its details.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use TYPE [search_box] [\"boxing gym Dallas, Texas\"] to input search term and location.\n- Use CLICK [search_button] to initiate search.\n- Use CLICK [filters_button] to open filters panel.\n- Use CLICK [personal_training_checkbox] and CLICK [monthly_membership_checkbox] to apply filters.\n- Use CLICK [sort_by_rating] to sort by highest rating.\n- Use CLICK [top_gym_result] to view the highest-rated gym."
      }
