      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find solutions for Airport and fill the contact form with message to \"Send Brochure\". Contact information John Smith. Email: abc@abc.com. Phone #: 88889999",
        "memory_description": "Contact form submission task failed due to incorrect input in name field and phone number; correct workflow requires precise form field targeting and accurate data entry.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Form Submission\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the contact form on flightaware.com.\n2. Locate the 'Name' field and input 'John Smith' exactly as specified.\n3. Find the 'Email' field and type 'abc@abc.com' without any typos.\n4. Identify the 'Phone' field and enter '88889999' precisely (note: avoid adding extra digits).\n5. Locate the 'Message' field and type 'Send Brochure' exactly.\n6. Submit the form by clicking the 'Submit' button.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure each form field is correctly identified by its unique element ID or label.\n- Match input values exactly with the provided data (case-sensitive, no extra spaces or characters).\n- Confirm the 'Submit' button is clicked only after all fields are correctly filled."
      }
