        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Search & Navigation\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to instacart.com and search for 'Costco' using the search bar.\n2. Click on the 'Costco' store link in the search results.\n3. Once on Costco's page, locate and click on the 'Grocery' category or 'Deals' section (e.g., element with ID or class related to grocery deals).\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use `CLICK [element_id]` syntax for interactions.\n- Ensure the element selected corresponds to a visible and actionable UI component (e.g., a category link or deal banner).\n- If the 'Deals' section is not immediately visible, use filters or scroll to locate it.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence:\n`CLICK [search_bar]` -> `TYPE 'Costco'` -> `CLICK [search_result_link]` -> `CLICK [grocery_deals_section]`"
      }
