        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation (Play a specific track on a music website).\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Top Tracks' or 'Chart' section on last.fm.\n2. Locate the track at number 1 in the chart list.\n3. Identify the 'Play' button associated with that track (usually a play icon or 'Play' text link).\n4. Execute the action: `CLICK [play_button_element_id]`.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the element selected corresponds to the 'Play' action for the top track.\n- Use accurate element IDs or XPath locators that are present in the cleaned HTML.\n- Verify that the target element is visible and interactive before clicking."
