        "memory_description": "Filter-based search task failed due to incorrect element selection for year range and missing color filter step; correct workflow requires precise element targeting and inclusion of color filter.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Filter-based search on a car listings website (carmax). \n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. TYPE [213] [Toyota Corolla] - Enter the vehicle make and model.\n2. CLICK [5981] - Select the 'Search' or 'Find Cars' button to proceed.\n3. CLICK [8613] - Navigate to the 'Year' filter section.\n4. CLICK [77459] - Open the year range selector (e.g., '2018-2023').\n5. SELECT [78298] [2018-2023] - Apply the year range filter.\n6. CLICK [94813] - Navigate to the 'Color' filter section.\n7. SELECT [color_filter_element] [Red] - Apply the red color filter.\n8. CLICK [110951] - Submit or apply all filters.\n9. CLICK [126879] - View the filtered results.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure each clickable element is correctly identified by its unique ID or class.\n- Use SELECT for dropdowns or range selectors, and CLICK for buttons or navigation links.\n- Always verify that the target element exists in the current page's HTML before interacting with it."
      }
