        "content_body": "Task Type: Location-based search for rental vehicles.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. CLICK [116] to open the search interface.\n2. TYPE [5223] [Portugal Cove] (ensure proper capitalization for accurate search results).\n3. CLICK [14526] to select the vehicle type (vans).\n4. CLICK [24920] to set the currency to USD.\n5. CLICK [35329] to apply the location and currency filters (correct element ID used here).\n6. CLICK [46525] to view the available rental options (if not skipped).\n7. CLICK [61725] to finalize or view the results.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always use proper capitalization in location inputs.\n- Verify element IDs for filtering options (e.g., currency, vehicle type, location) to ensure correct selection.\n- Ensure all steps have exact element matches and action F1 = 1 for success."
