      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find the top-rated bar and grill restaurant in Miami, Florida that has live music and is good for groups.",
        "memory_description": "This is a restaurant search task on a directory website; the agent failed to correctly identify and click on the relevant elements for filtering by live music and group suitability, leading to an incorrect selection of the top-rated restaurant.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Restaurant search with filters on a directory website (Yellow Pages).\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the search bar and input 'bar and grill Miami, Florida'.\n2. Click [SEARCH] button to load results.\n3. Locate and click the [FILTER] or [SORT BY RATING] option to sort results by highest rating.\n4. Scroll through the results and click on the [FILTER] or [MORE INFO] button for each restaurant.\n5. Within the restaurant details, look for the [LIVE MUSIC] and [GROUPS] checkboxes or tags and ensure they are selected.\n6. Click [APPLY FILTERS] or [SEARCH AGAIN] to narrow results.\n7. Select the top-rated restaurant from the filtered list by clicking on its [NAME] or [VIEW DETAILS] link.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise element identifiers (e.g., 'FILTER', 'SORT BY RATING', 'LIVE MUSIC', 'GROUPS', 'APPLY FILTERS').\n- Ensure all filters are applied before selecting a restaurant.\n- Confirm that the final selection includes all required attributes (live music, group-friendly, top-rated)."
      }
    },
