        "scenario_description": "What are the upcoming soccer events on ESPN2?",
        "memory_description": "Navigation task failed due to incorrect filtering of soccer events on ESPN2; the correct workflow requires selecting the 'Soccer' category and then filtering by 'ESPN2' channel.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation (Filtering Events)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the ESPN website.\n2. Locate and CLICK the 'Soccer' category filter (e.g., element ID [97171]).\n3. Once on the Soccer events page, locate and SELECT the 'ESPN2' channel filter (e.g., element ID [103316]).\n4. The upcoming soccer events on ESPN2 will now be displayed.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use CLICK for interactive elements like category buttons.\n- Use SELECT for dropdowns or filters that require choosing a specific option.\n- Ensure the correct element IDs are used for each action to avoid misnavigation."
