        "scenario_description": "Find an Indian classical track longer than 30 minutes which has been added in the past month and add to playlist named Meditation Music, if playlist not found create one.",
        "memory_description": "Search and playlist management task failed due to missing steps for filtering by duration, date added, and playlist creation; correct workflow includes explicit filtering and playlist creation logic.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Search and Playlist Management on SoundCloud\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. TYPE [Search Bar] [Indian classical] to search for tracks.\n2. CLICK [Search Result] to open the search results.\n3. FILTER [Duration] [>30 minutes] to narrow down tracks longer than 30 minutes.\n4. FILTER [Date Added] [Past Month] to select tracks added in the last month.\n5. CLICK [Track Title] to open the track details.\n6. CLICK [Add to Playlist] to open the playlist menu.\n7. TYPE [Playlist Name] [Meditation Music] to search for the playlist.\n8. IF [Playlist Not Found], CLICK [Create New Playlist], TYPE [Playlist Name] [Meditation Music], and CLICK [Create].\n9. CLICK [Add to Playlist] to add the track to the playlist.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use explicit filters for duration and date added.\n- Always check if the playlist exists before attempting to add a track.\n- Use exact syntax for playlist creation and addition."
      }
