        "content_body": "Task Type: Travel Requirements Lookup\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Qatar Airways website.\n2. Locate and click the 'Book a Flight' or 'Flights' section (element ID: 23906).\n3. In the origin field (element ID: 36001), type 'Amsterdam' as the departure city.\n4. In the destination field (element ID: 75982), type 'Cairo' as the arrival city.\n5. Click the 'Search' or 'Find Flights' button (element ID: 103653) to retrieve flight options.\n6. Review the travel requirements displayed on the results page (element ID: 116007) for any visa, health, or documentation needs.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the correct input fields are used for origin and destination by matching element IDs.\n- Always type the city names directly into the input fields, not into search bars or other UI elements.\n- Confirm that the 'Search' button is clicked after entering both origin and destination to trigger the requirements display."
      }
