      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "What are the food festivals happening in Colorado This weekend?",
        "memory_description": "Search task failed due to incorrect initial search term and subsequent mis-clicks; fix by using 'food festival' as the search term and following correct navigation steps.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Search Task (Event Search)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Open Eventbrite website.\n2. Locate the search bar (typically at the top of the page) and type: `TYPE [search_bar] [food festival]`.\n3. Press Enter or click the search button to filter events.\n4. Use the location filter (usually a dropdown or text field) and type: `TYPE [location_filter] [Colorado]`.\n5. Apply the filter and click on the 'This Weekend' or similar time filter option to narrow results to the current weekend.\n6. Review the list of events displayed and click on relevant food festival listings to gather details."
      }
