        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Search Task (Event Search)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to Eventbrite's search page.\n2. Locate the 'Location' input field (e.g., with ID or class name 'location-input') and type 'San Francisco' (note: correct spelling and capitalization).\n3. Locate the 'Category' filter (e.g., with ID or class name 'category-filter') and click on 'Fashion' to apply the category filter.\n4. Ensure the 'Free' filter is applied (e.g., click on a 'Free' checkbox or filter option).\n5. Scroll through the event listings and click on the first three event cards (e.g., with class name 'event-card') to save them as top results.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always use exact element identifiers (IDs, classes, or XPath) for reliable interaction.\n- Ensure input values match expected format (e.g., proper capitalization, no typos).\n- Confirm filters are applied before proceeding to results."
