        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Search with Filter Application\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Yellow Pages homepage.\n2. Locate the search bar and type: `message services near Henderson`.\n3. Click the search button or press Enter to load results.\n4. Scroll through the results and look for a filter or sort option (e.g., 'BBB Rating').\n5. Apply the filter to show only providers with a BBB rating of `A+`.\n6. Review the filtered results to find the nearest message service providers.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise search terms that include location and service type.\n- Always check for filters or sorting options related to ratings or proximity.\n- Ensure each action (e.g., CLICK, TYPE) is applied to the correct UI element based on its ID or visible text.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence Syntax:\n- TYPE [search_bar] `message services near Henderson`\n- CLICK [search_button]\n- CLICK [filter_dropdown]\n- CLICK [BBB_rating_A_plus]\n- CLICK [result_item]"
