        "memory_description": "Gift card balance check task failed due to incorrect action types (TYPE instead of CLICK) on critical form fields; correct by using CLICK for input fields and ensuring proper action syntax.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Gift Card Balance Check\nWebsite: Marriott\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Click on the 'Gift Card Balance' option (element ID: 15382).\n2. Click on the 'Check Balance' button (element ID: 30644).\n3. Click on the gift card number input field (element ID: 31279).\n4. Type the gift card number '1234567' into the field.\n5. Click on the PIN input field (element ID: 32694).\n6. Type the PIN '0001' into the field.\n7. Click on the 'Submit' or 'Check' button (element ID: 34112).\n8. Confirm the balance is displayed on the page.\nUI Rules: Always use CLICK to activate input fields before typing. Ensure action syntax is `CLICK [element_id]` or `TYPE [element_id] [value]`."
