      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find the cheapest single room in Dubai Marriott or Sheraton for two adults and a child under one between May 7 and May 10",
        "memory_description": "Hotel booking task failed due to incorrect selection of date range and room type; correct workflow requires precise input of dates and specifying the correct room type for a child under one.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Hotel Booking\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Marriott or Sheraton website (e.g., marriott.com).\n2. Click on 'Search Hotels' or 'Find Hotels'.\n3. In the destination field, type 'Dubai' and select 'Dubai' from the dropdown.\n4. Click on 'Check-in' and input 'May 7' as the check-in date.\n5. Click on 'Check-out' and input 'May 10' as the check-out date.\n6. Click on 'Rooms' and select '1 room' with '2 adults' and '1 child under 1 year'.\n7. Click 'Search' to view available rooms.\n8. Filter results by price to find the cheapest single room.\n9. Review the room details and confirm the booking if needed.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the correct dates are selected in the check-in/check-out fields.\n- Use the 'Rooms' dropdown to specify the correct number of adults and children.\n- Use the 'Sort by Price' option to identify the cheapest room.\n- Avoid skipping steps or assuming defaults for room types or dates."
      }
