      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Check the status of your iPhone repair.",
        "memory_description": "The task was a web navigation task to check the status of an iPhone repair, but the first step failed due to an incorrect or missing element selection, requiring a revised action sequence with precise UI interactions.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation (iPhone Repair Status Check)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Apple Support website (https://www.apple.com/support/).\n2. Locate and click the 'Check Repair Status' button (element ID: 1066) on the homepage.\n3. Enter your repair reference number and click 'Continue' (element ID: 3859).\n4. Review the repair status and click 'Close' or 'Done' (element ID: 5514) to complete the task.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the correct element ID is used for each action.\n- Verify that the action syntax follows the format: `CLICK [element_id]`.\n- Confirm that the element is visible and clickable before performing the action."
      }
