        "scenario_description": "Find cheapest flight from New York to Toronto, Canada on 29 April.",
        "memory_description": "Flight search task failed due to incorrect city input and missing sorting step; fix by entering city without country and applying price filter.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Flight Search\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to JetBlue's flight search page.\n2. TYPE [origin] [New York] into the origin field.\n3. CLICK [search button] to proceed.\n4. TYPE [destination] [Toronto] into the destination field (do not include country).\n5. CLICK [search button] to submit the search.\n6. CLICK [date selector] to select 29 April.\n7. CLICK [apply date] to confirm the date.\n8. CLICK [sort by price] to sort results from lowest to highest.\n9. CLICK [cheapest flight] to select the lowest-priced option.\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use exact city names without country codes unless required.\n- Ensure all steps match the exact element IDs and action syntax as defined in the HTML.\n- Always apply sorting before selecting a flight to ensure the cheapest option is visible."
