      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find black shorts in XXL or 3XL sizes for sale under men department, add the top product to the cart.",
        "memory_description": "Product search task failed due to incorrect navigation steps and missing size filter application; correct workflow requires filtering by size after selecting the men's department and product category.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search & Add to Cart\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Men' department by clicking the correct department link (e.g., 'Men' in the navigation bar).\n2. Click on the 'Shorts' category under the men's department.\n3. Apply a filter for 'Black' color using the color filter option (e.g., click on the black swatch or select 'Black' from the color dropdown).\n4. Apply a size filter for 'XXL' or '3XL' using the size dropdown or size filter option.\n5. Once the filtered results are displayed, click on the top product in the search results (e.g., the first product thumbnail or title).\n6. Click the 'Add to Cart' button on the product detail page.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise element selectors (e.g., `CLICK [element_id]`) based on the cleaned HTML.\n- Ensure filters are applied before selecting products.\n- Confirm that the product meets all criteria (color, size, department) before adding to cart."
      }
