        "scenario_description": "Find medicaid covered dentists sorted by distance.",
        "memory_description": "Search task failed due to incorrect selection of a filter element; the correct action is to click, not select, the Medicaid filter.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Search (Filtering Results)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the search results page for dentists.\n2. Locate the 'Insurance' or 'Filter by Insurance' section on the page.\n3. CLICK the 'Medicaid' filter option (not SELECT, as it is a clickable checkbox or button).\n4. Ensure the results are sorted by distance by clicking the 'Sort by Distance' option, typically found in a dropdown or sorting menu.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use CLICK for checkboxes, buttons, or links that trigger filters or sorting.\n- Avoid using SELECT for non-dropdown elements; SELECT is reserved for dropdown menus.\n- Always verify that the correct element is selected by checking the HTML ID or text content."
