      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find the weight of baggage allowance for economy class on a flight from Japan to Iran.",
        "memory_description": "This was a baggage allowance lookup task; the initial step failed due to incorrect element selection, requiring a more precise navigation path to the relevant section.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Information Retrieval (Baggage Allowance)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Baggage' or 'Luggage' section of the Qatar Airways website.\n2. Select the 'Economy Class' option.\n3. Choose the route 'Japan to Iran' or filter by origin and destination.\n4. Locate and click on the 'Baggage Allowance' or 'Weight Limits' section.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use explicit selectors for 'Economy Class' and 'Japan to Iran' filters.\n- Ensure the 'Baggage Allowance' section is fully loaded before clicking.\n- Correct syntax: CLICK [element_id] where element_id corresponds to the 'Baggage Allowance' section after filtering by class and route."
      }
