        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Search and Filter Task\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the search bar (typically located at the top of the page).\n2. Type the exact search query: `TYPE [284] [Pop Workout]` to ensure the search term matches the target.\n3. After the search results appear, locate the filter section (usually on the left-hand side or above the results).\n4. Click on the filter option for the tag `#Dance & edm` (e.g., `CLICK [tag_filter_id]` where `tag_filter_id` corresponds to the correct UI element for the `#Dance & edm` tag).\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the search term is exact and matches the target to avoid irrelevant results.\n- Apply filters after the initial search to narrow down results effectively.\n- Use the correct element IDs for actions (e.g., `CLICK [45512]` for search submission, `CLICK [tag_filter_id]` for tag filtering)."
