      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Book two rooms for four adults in a 5-star hotel with pool, minibar, bathtub, and spa facilities, that are nearest to the city center in Dubai from June 13 to 16.",
        "memory_description": "Hotel booking task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing steps in filtering hotel amenities and location, requiring precise UI interaction and explicit filtering criteria.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Hotel Booking\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Ryanair website and click on the 'Hotels' section (element ID: 399).\n2. In the destination field (element ID: 2012), type 'DUBAI' in uppercase to match the expected format.\n3. Click on the 'Search' button (element ID: 3913) to initiate the search.\n4. Select the '5-star' rating filter (element ID: 6305) to narrow down results.\n5. Click on the 'Near City Center' location filter (element ID: 8921) to ensure proximity to the city center.\n6. Click on the 'Facilities' filter (element ID: 12931) and select 'Pool', 'Minibar', 'Bathtub', and 'Spa' (element IDs: 16939, 21057, 25686, 30158).\n7. Set the check-in date to June 13 and check-out date to June 16 (element IDs: 22228, 26970, 29131, 33238).\n8. Click on the 'Search' button again (element ID: 42828) to refine results.\n9. Select a hotel that matches all criteria (element ID: 52428).\n10. Click on 'Book' (element ID: 62014) and select '2 rooms' for '4 adults' (element IDs: 71592, 81653).\n11. Confirm the booking (element ID: 86907) and complete the payment (element ID: 96647).\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always use uppercase for city names (e.g., 'DUBAI').\n- Ensure all filters (amenities, location, dates) are explicitly selected before proceeding.\n- Verify that the correct number of rooms and guests is selected before finalizing the booking."
      }
    },
