        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation (Deal/Ticket Lookup)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the main page of the 'sixflags' website.\n2. Locate and CLICK the element with ID [1052], which corresponds to the 'Deals' or 'Tickets' section for Great Escape Park.\n3. After clicking, ensure the page redirects to the deals section.\n4. If necessary, scroll or search for specific deals using the site's search functionality.\n5. Confirm the deals are displayed and record them.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Always verify the element ID matches the target action.\n- Use CLICK actions only on elements that are interactive (e.g., buttons, links).\n- If a step fails, re-evaluate the element selection and ensure it aligns with the task goal.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence:\nCLICK [1052] -> CLICK [12002] -> CLICK [21739] -> CLICK [45429]"
