      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Rent a small air-conditioned car with collision damage coverage from the Liverpool Airport car rental center for pick-up on May 5, 11:30 am, and drop-off on May 7, 11 am.",
        "memory_description": "Car rental task failed due to incorrect selection of drop-off time and navigation errors; correct by precisely selecting drop-off time and following the correct UI flow.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Car Rental Booking\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. TYPE [135] [LIVERPOOL] to select the Liverpool Airport location.\n2. CLICK [3675] to proceed to the car selection page.\n3. CLICK [7013] to choose a small car category.\n4. CLICK [10814] to select an air-conditioned car.\n5. CLICK [14591] to add collision damage coverage.\n6. SELECT [17862] [11 30 AM] to set the pick-up time.\n7. SELECT [21148] [11 00 AM] to set the drop-off time.\n8. CLICK [24940] to confirm the dates and proceed.\n9. CLICK [27946] to select the rental center.\n10. CLICK [43311] to continue with the booking process.\n11. CLICK [54566] to review the booking summary.\n12. CLICK [59340] to confirm the booking.\n13. CLICK [63318] to complete the task.\nUI Interaction Rules: Ensure exact match of element IDs and values, especially for time and date fields. Use SELECT for dropdowns and CLICK for buttons. Always verify the correct element ID and value before interacting."
      }
