      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find a vacation home in Orlando with a private pool, at least three bedrooms, and availability for the first week of December.",
        "memory_description": "This is a search/filter task on Expedia for vacation homes; the agent failed due to incorrect element selection during filtering steps, specifically for pool, bedroom count, and availability; the correct workflow requires precise interaction with filter options and date selectors.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Search/Filter Task on Expedia for Vacation Homes\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. TYPE [3820] [Orlando] - Enter destination.\n2. CLICK [7535] - Select 'Vacation Homes' option.\n3. CLICK [11413] - Open search filters.\n4. CLICK [15061] - Select 'Private Pool' filter.\n5. CLICK [18758] - Select '3+ Bedrooms' filter.\n6. CLICK [33841] - Open availability calendar.\n7. CLICK [38063] - Select check-in date (December 1st).\n8. CLICK [42655] - Select check-out date (December 8th).\n9. CLICK [56422] - Apply filters and search.\n10. CLICK [60634] - View available listings.\n11. CLICK [62672] - Select a listing with all required criteria.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure filter options are selected from the correct dropdowns or checkboxes.\n- Use exact date selectors in the calendar view for availability.\n- Confirm that all filters (pool, bedrooms, dates) are applied before proceeding."
