      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Show me a list of electronic music dvds in very good condition.",
        "memory_description": "Filter-based search task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing condition filter; fix by using the correct search input and applying the 'very good' condition filter.",
        "content_body": "To show a list of electronic music dvds in very good condition on Discogs, follow this workflow:\n\n1. Locate the search input field (typically labeled 'Search' or with an icon) and type: `electronic music dvd`.\n2. Click the 'Search' button or press Enter to execute the search.\n3. On the results page, locate the filter options (usually on the left sidebar) and click on the 'Condition' filter.\n4. Select the 'Very Good' option from the condition dropdown.\n5. Click 'Apply' or 'Filter' to update the results list.\n\nEnsure that each step involves the correct UI element and that the action syntax matches the target exactly (e.g., `CLICK [element_id]` where the element_id corresponds to the correct search box, filter, or option)."
      }
