      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find bluetooth vertical mouse with most reviews and add two to my shopping cart..",
        "memory_description": "Product search and selection task failed due to incorrect initial search input and missing steps to navigate to product details and add items to cart; correct workflow requires precise search, sorting by reviews, and explicit add-to-cart actions.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search and Selection\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the search bar (typically identified by 'search' or 'input' attributes) and TYPE [search_term] [bluetooth vertical mouse].\n2. CLICK [search_button] to execute the search.\n3. Locate the product sorting/filtering options (often under a 'Sort By' dropdown or similar element) and SELECT [sort_option] [Most Reviews].\n4. Identify the top product in the results (ensure it is a 'bluetooth vertical mouse') and CLICK [product_title] or [product_image] to open the product page.\n5. Verify product details match the criteria (bluetooth, vertical mouse), then CLICK [add_to_cart_button] to add one unit to the cart.\n6. RETURN to the product page or search results and repeat STEP 5 to add a second unit to the cart.\n7. Confirm both items are in the cart by navigating to the cart icon and verifying the quantity.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise search terms and ensure the search is executed with a CLICK on the search button.\n- Always validate product details before adding to cart.\n- Use explicit CLICK actions on buttons like 'Add to Cart' to ensure successful addition."
      }
