      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Schedule an appointment to apply for transportation access pass in  the Charlie Card store on May 8, 10:15 am, fill in my details (James Smith, james.smith@gmail.com), and book.",
        "memory_description": "Appointment scheduling task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing steps in form submission; correct workflow requires precise navigation and data entry.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Appointment Scheduling\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the MBTA website and locate the 'Schedule an Appointment' section.\n2. Click on the 'Charlie Card Store' option to select the service type.\n3. Choose the date (May 8) and time (10:15 AM) for the appointment.\n4. Fill in the required personal details: Name = 'James Smith', Email = 'james.smith@gmail.com'.\n5. Review the appointment details and click the 'Book' or 'Submit' button to confirm the appointment.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the correct date and time fields are selected using the appropriate calendar/time picker UI elements.\n- Use the 'TYPE' action with exact syntax: TYPE [element_id] [value], e.g., TYPE [22836] [James Smith], TYPE [23632] [james.smith@gmail.com].\n- Confirm all steps are completed before clicking the final 'Book' button."
      }
