        "scenario_description": "Add a set of wireless headphones to your cart with a budget of $100 or less, that has an active noise-cancelling feature.",
        "memory_description": "Search task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing budget filter application; correct workflow requires precise filtering by both feature and price.",
