      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Look for the lowest priced new aluminum fish boat within 100 miles of Iowa state zip 52554 and call for price.",
        "memory_description": "Product search and location-based pricing task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing steps for entering zip code and filtering results.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product search with location-based filtering and contact request.\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Boats' or 'Fishing Boats' section of the Cabelas website.\n2. Use the search bar to type: 'new aluminum fish boat'.\n3. Locate and click on the 'Filter by Location' or 'Store Locator' option.\n4. Enter the zip code '52554' in the designated field and set the radius to '100 miles'.\n5. Apply the filter to view available boats within the specified area.\n6. Sort results by price (ascending) to find the lowest priced new aluminum fish boat.\n7. Click on the product to view details, then locate and click the 'Call for Price' button or contact information.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use 'CLICK' for buttons and filters.\n- Use 'TYPE' for entering text (e.g., zip code).\n- Ensure all filters are applied before viewing results.\n- Always verify that the correct product is selected before initiating contact."
      }
