      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find the page with instructions on how to return orders online.",
        "memory_description": "The task was a web navigation task to find return instructions; the agent failed due to incorrect element selection in the second step, requiring a revised action sequence with precise UI interactions.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation (Finding Information)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Customer Service' or 'Help' section of the Uniqlo website, typically found in the main navigation menu or footer.\n2. Look for a link labeled 'Returns & Exchanges' or 'How to Return an Order'.\n3. Click on the relevant link to access the return instructions page.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence:\n- CLICK [element_id='customer-service-link']\n- CLICK [element_id='returns-exchanges-link']\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Ensure the clicked element contains the exact text 'Returns & Exchanges' or similar.\n- Verify that the second click leads to a page with return instructions, confirmed by page title or content."
      }
