        "content_body": "Task Type: Web-based search and booking for a multi-city European cruise deal with specific criteria (10+ nights, under $999, best-rated).\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. CLICK [652] - Open the cruise deals section.\n2. CLICK [4207] - Navigate to the cruise search or filter options.\n3. CLICK [14802] - Select the 'multi-city' filter option (not typing into a field).\n4. CLICK [22012] - Apply the '10+ night' duration filter.\n5. CLICK [27877] - Set the price range to under $999.\n6. CLICK [33679] - Sort or filter by 'best-rated' or 'top-rated' results.\n7. CLICK [39461] - Select the best-rated cruise deal that matches the criteria.\n8. Complete the booking process by following the on-screen prompts.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use CLICK actions for filters and sorting options, not TYPE actions.\n- Ensure each step matches the exact element ID and action as specified in the target trajectory.\n- Always verify that the element exists in the cleaned HTML before proceeding."
