      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find lowest price SUV  for a partner AARP SUV deal discount for pickup Roanoke Regional Airport, ROA Sat, Apr 05, 12:00 PM and drop off on April 10th.",
        "memory_description": "This is a car rental price comparison task where the agent failed to correctly identify and interact with the necessary UI elements for location and time selection, leading to incorrect actions and task failure.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Car Rental Price Comparison\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. CLICK [139] to open the car rental search form.\n2. CLICK [9805] to select the pickup location field.\n3. TYPE [9805] 'Roanoke Regional Airport, ROA' to input the pickup location.\n4. CLICK [14675] to select the drop-off location field.\n5. TYPE [14675] 'Roanoke Regional Airport, ROA' to input the drop-off location.\n6. CLICK [34071] to select the pickup date field.\n7. TYPE [34071] 'Apr 05, 2025' to input the pickup date.\n8. CLICK [43498] to select the pickup time field.\n9. TYPE [43498] '12:00 PM' to input the pickup time.\n10. CLICK [62087] to select the drop-off date field.\n11. TYPE [62087] 'Apr 10, 2025' to input the drop-off date.\n12. CLICK [80683] to select the vehicle type field.\n13. SELECT [80683] 'SUV' to choose the vehicle type.\n14. CLICK [112258] to submit the search and find the lowest price with AARP discount."
      }
