      "payload": {
        "scenario_description": "Find the cheapest free SUV upgrade deal with a pay-later option for an Australian for a pick up on June 2, 11 am, and drop off on June 6 at 4:30 pm from Ontario International Airport.",
        "memory_description": "This is a car rental deal search task where the agent failed due to incorrect element selection and missing steps in specifying location, dates, and payment options; the correct workflow requires precise UI interactions and explicit filtering for 'free SUV upgrade' and 'pay-later' options.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Car Rental Deal Search\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the car rental deals section of the website.\n2. Select the 'Pickup Location' field and type 'Ontario International Airport' exactly as it appears in the dropdown.\n3. Select the 'Drop-off Location' field and ensure it matches the pickup location (if applicable) or select the correct drop-off location.\n4. Set the 'Pickup Date' to June 2, 11:00 AM using the date picker or by typing 'June 2, 11:00 AM' into the field.\n5. Set the 'Drop-off Date' to June 6, 4:30 PM using the date picker or by typing 'June 6, 4:30 PM' into the field.\n6. Filter the results by selecting 'SUV' as the vehicle type.\n7. Apply a filter for 'Free Upgrade' or 'Free SUV Upgrade' in the deal options.\n8. Apply a filter for 'Pay Later' or 'Pay-Later' in the payment options.\n9. Sort the results by price (ascending) to find the cheapest option.\n10. Click on the cheapest deal that meets all criteria (free SUV upgrade, pay-later, correct dates, and location).\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use exact match for location names (e.g., 'Ontario International Airport')\n- Use correct date/time format (e.g., 'June 2, 11:00 AM')\n- Ensure all filters (vehicle type, upgrade, payment) are explicitly applied\n- Confirm that all steps are completed before proceeding to the next"
      }
    },
