        "scenario_description": "Browse Marriott Bonvoy credit cards.",
        "memory_description": "Navigation task failed due to incorrect element selection; correct workflow requires locating and clicking the correct credit card section on the Marriott Bonvoy website.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Navigation\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Open the Marriott Bonvoy website (https://www.marriottbonvoy.com/).\n2. Locate the 'Credit Cards' section, typically found in the main navigation menu or under a 'Rewards' or 'Membership' tab.\n3. Click on the 'Credit Cards' link to access the relevant page.\n4. If the page requires further navigation, look for a 'View All Credit Cards' button or similar UI element and click it.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise selectors (e.g., text='Credit Cards') to ensure correct element targeting.\n- Verify that the clicked element leads to the intended page by checking the URL or page content.\n- If the element is not visible, ensure the page is fully loaded and scroll to the appropriate section if needed.\n\nCorrect Action Sequence (Syntax):\n[CLICK [element='Credit Cards' text='Credit Cards']]"
      }
