        "scenario_description": "Tell me information about what identification I need to bring on my trip.",
        "memory_description": "This was an information retrieval task where the agent failed to correctly identify and click the right elements to find ID requirements; the correct workflow involves navigating to the 'Travel Information' section and clicking the 'What to Bring' link.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Information Retrieval\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Amtrak website (https://www.amtrak.com/).\n2. Locate and click the 'Travel Information' link in the main navigation menu.\n3. On the 'Travel Information' page, find and click the 'What to Bring' link.\n4. Read the content on the 'What to Bring' page to find the required identification for your trip.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use precise element selectors based on visible text and context.\n- Avoid clicking elements that do not match the target action or content.\n- Ensure each step matches the expected element and action (e.g., CLICK [\"What to Bring\"])."
