        "scenario_description": "Find the last game of the season for the Toronto Raptors.",
        "memory_description": "This was a sports data retrieval task where the agent incorrectly typed the team name instead of clicking the correct navigation element to access game schedules, leading to failure.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Sports Data Retrieval\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the Yahoo Sports homepage (sports.yahoo.com).\n2. Locate and CLICK the 'NBA' or 'Basketball' section link in the navigation menu.\n3. Find and CLICK the 'Toronto Raptors' team page link.\n4. On the team page, locate and CLICK the 'Schedule' or 'Season Games' section.\n5. Scroll to the bottom of the schedule to identify the last game of the season.\nUI Interaction Rules: Use CLICK actions on visible, clickable elements (e.g., links, buttons) that correspond to the team or schedule sections. Avoid typing text unless in a search or input field."
      }
