        "content_body": "Task Type: Web Search (Filter-based)\n\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'Cruises' or 'Adventure Cruises' section on travelzoo.com.\n2. Locate the 'Destination' filter and click on it.\n3. Type 'Alaska' into the destination search field and select it from the dropdown.\n4. Locate the 'Price' filter and click on it.\n5. Set the maximum price to '999' and apply the filter.\n6. Review the filtered results to find adventure cruises under $999 for Alaska.\n\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use 'CLICK' on filter elements (e.g., 'Destination', 'Price').\n- Use 'TYPE' to input values (e.g., 'Alaska', '999') into search fields.\n- Ensure each step matches the target element and action exactly for success."
