        "scenario_description": "Add the cheapest SSD to my cart",
        "memory_description": "Product search task failed due to incorrect element selection and missing UI interaction steps; fix by filtering SSDs by price and using correct click/select actions.",
        "content_body": "Task Type: Product Search & Purchase\nCorrect Workflow:\n1. Navigate to the 'SSD' category on Newegg.\n2. Use the filter option to sort by 'Price: Low to High'.\n3. Select the first item in the sorted list (cheapest SSD).\n4. Click the 'Add to Cart' button on the product page.\nUI Interaction Rules:\n- Use SELECT [filter_element] [Price: Low to High] to sort.\n- Use CLICK [product_card] to select the cheapest SSD.\n- Use CLICK [add_to_cart_button] to add the item to the cart.\nEnsure all actions are performed on visible and correctly identified elements."
